  a' cappella vocal workshops. Explore your vocal abilities by joining us f
 or an interactive session that covers vocal training\, a cappella techniqu
 es\, and group singing tips. Our experienced director will guide you throu
 gh the basics of harmonizing\, breath control\, and performance skills. Ge
 t ready to discover the joy of making music together in a supportive envir
 onment. Come join us for an evening of fun songs and tags!
